design, icon and the documentation in this repository of the game "Hamsi Koyu" (formerly "Balıkçı Tycoon") (the
"Game"). Third-party components (e.g. the Pixelify Sans font, Capacitor) are governed by their own licenses; see
`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.

**2. What you may do.** Free of charge, as long as you follow the conditions below, you may:
- a) Download and play the Game from its official sources (the official website, the App Store, Google Play).
- b) Read, study and learn from the source code.
- c) Run and modify the Game on your own devices for personal, non-commercial purposes only (without sharing your
  modified version with others).
- d) Fork the repository on GitHub, to the extent the GitHub Terms of Service allow, solely to report issues or
  propose contributions (pull requests).
- e) Make and share videos, live streams, reviews, screenshots and articles about the Game — including earning money
  from that content (e.g. video platform revenue).

**3. What you may not do.** Without the copyright holder's prior written permission, you may not:
- a) Publish, distribute, sell or rent the Game or any substantial part of it, modified or not, on any app store,
  website, game portal or as a file (APK, IPA, ZIP, etc.).
- b) Use the Game or any work derived from it with ads, in-app purchases, subscriptions, fundraising or for any other
  commercial purpose.
- c) Use the name "Hamsi Koyu", the Game's icon or visual identity to promote your own product or to suggest a
  connection with the Game. (This license grants no trademark rights.)
- d) Transfer or sublicense this license or any permission in it.
- e) Remove copyright or license notices.

**4. Contributions.** By submitting a contribution (pull request, patch, artwork, text, etc.) to this repository, you
confirm that it is your own work or that you have the right to submit it this way, and you grant the copyright holder
a perpetual, worldwide, royalty-free, non-exclusive and irrevocable license to use, modify, publish on any medium
(including app stores) and sublicense your contribution as part of the Game.

**5. No warranty.** The Game is provided "as is", without any express or implied warranty. To the fullest extent
permitted by law, the copyright holder is not liable for any damage arising from the use of the Game.

**6. Termination.** If you breach any condition of this license, all permissions granted to you end automatically.
All other rights of the copyright holder under Turkish Law No. 5846 on Intellectual and Artistic Works and other laws
are reserved.

**7. Other permissions.** For any use not permitted here (e.g. a school project, an exhibition, a translation, a port
to another platform), contact the copyright holder on GitHub: https://github.com/recaikas

**8. Governing law.** This license is governed by the laws of the Republic of Türkiye. The courts and enforcement
